00:22:50,240 --> 00:22:55,240
仅是开车每年你就有40个微死亡的风险。
Just driving puts you at a 40-micromort risk every year.

411
00:22:55,240 --> 00:22:58,240
我们无法预测未来会发生什么，所以，
We can't predict what's gonna happen, and so in a sense,

