00:23:05,640 --> 00:23:06,240
我们并不想知道
We don't want to know

416
00:23:06,240 --> 00:23:08,240
未来到底会发生什么，
exactly what's gonna happen in the future.

417
00:23:08,240 --> 00:23:09,240
不然我们会很痛苦。
That would be pretty miserable.

418
00:23:12,240 --> 00:23:14,240
运气，
Luck.

